#!/bin/sh
#
# Pre-push gate for ServanaClientAPP.
#
# There is no CI. On 2026-08-20 `.github/workflows/flutter-ci.yml` was DELETED,
# here and in every other repository — Actions credit is not being topped up, so
# "disabled" was replaced with "absent", which cannot be re-enabled by accident.
# So these three commands ARE the deploy step, and until recently nothing
# enforced them — the discipline was manual, and manual discipline is what a
# tired evening removes first.
#
# The deleted workflow's `validate` job ran exactly these three checks, so
# nothing is lost by its going. Its coverage upload is deliberately not
# reproduced: on 2026-08-05 it failed with "Artifact storage quota has been hit"
# as the LAST step of the FIRST job, and because every other job needed
# validate, no release could be built for days because a few KB of lcov could
# not be stored.
#
# What the workflow did that this hook does NOT is build and sign a release.
# That is `scripts/release-android.sh`, run deliberately, with the signing
# secrets in the environment — minutes rather than seconds, so not a hook.
#
# On 2026-08-20 a sweep found 46 defects that all three gates would not have
# caught on their own, but which the test suite now does: 62 screens are
# rendered at three handset sizes and three text scales, including 2.0. That
# suite is the reason `flutter test` below is not optional.
#
# stdin is redirected from /dev/null for every command. git hands a pre-push
# hook the ref list on stdin, and a child process inherits that pipe and can
# block on it forever. The backend's hook hung for 7.8 hours on its first real
# push before this was understood; do not remove the redirects.
#
# Install (per clone — git does not do this for you):
#     git config core.hooksPath scripts/hooks
#
# Never use --no-verify. If a check fails for a reason about the MACHINE rather
# than the code, fix the check: three of the backend's gates asserted Linux-only
# facts and blocked every push from a Windows machine until they were repaired.

set -e

echo "pre-push: no CI runs after this, so these gates are the deploy step"

echo "pre-push: dart format --set-exit-if-changed ."
dart format --set-exit-if-changed . < /dev/null

echo "pre-push: flutter analyze --no-fatal-infos"
flutter analyze --no-fatal-infos < /dev/null

echo "pre-push: flutter test"
flutter test < /dev/null

echo "pre-push: all three gates green; allowing the push"
